{"id":1880470,"shortDescription":"Jesús no falleció en la cruz, sino que bajó de ella y desató su venganza contra todos los infieles. 1500 años después, un ejército de inquisidores imponen la fe de forma salvaje. En este juego de aventuras y fantasía oscura, resolverás casos complejos y revelarás secretos profundos en la piel del inquisidor Mordimer Madderdin.","developers":["The Dust S.A."],"publishers":["Kalypso Media"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Cromos de Steam","Se recomienda usar un mando","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"8 FEB 2024","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880470/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1786957806","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880470/ss_a2346f8936fe26c50f157fa33c5cf4118afa4e6a.600x338.jpg?t=1786957806","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880470/ss_a2346f8936fe26c50f157fa33c5cf4118afa4e6a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786957806"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880470/ss_4edaa5aecb14024e3a419edc485c168bed77e45f.600x338.jpg?t=1786957806","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880470/ss_4edaa5aecb14024e3a419edc485c168bed77e45f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786957806"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880470/ss_2a091e697bde30037229702f67b5bf3e63a89edc.600x338.jpg?t=1786957806","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880470/ss_2a091e697bde30037229702f67b5bf3e63a89edc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786957806"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880470/ss_48e6e968a0ac39840c063cce39a471886f4e3252.600x338.jpg?t=1786957806","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880470/ss_48e6e968a0ac39840c063cce39a471886f4e3252.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786957806"},{"thumb":"ht